1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:03,280
(Sheldon:)Have a seat.
We'll get started with the interview.

2
00:00:03,449 --> 00:00:04,489
(Raj:)You're kidding.

3
00:00:05,243 --> 00:00:06,533
(Prof Laughlin:)Please.

4
00:00:07,954 --> 00:00:09,784
(Howard:)All right.

5
00:00:10,373 --> 00:00:11,663
[RAJ SIGHS]

6
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:13,713
(Sheldon:)So....

7
00:00:16,337 --> 00:00:18,837
(Sheldon:)That's what you wear to an interview?

8
00:00:19,882 --> 00:00:21,722
Come on, we've been friends for years.

9
00:00:21,884 --> 00:00:24,974
(Sheldon:)Oh, pulling strings, are we?

10
00:00:25,304 --> 00:00:28,394
(Raj:)Sheldon, for God's sakes,
don't make me beg.

11
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:31,230
Buzzinga.

12
00:00:31,519 --> 00:00:36,149
(Sheldon:)You've fallen victim to another one
of my classic practical jokes.

13
00:00:37,483 --> 00:00:40,573
(Sheldon:)I'm your boss now.
You may wanna laugh at that.

14
00:00:43,865 --> 00:00:47,205
Ah. This is nice,
having the place to ourselves, isn't it?

15
00:00:47,368 --> 00:00:48,408
(Leonard:)Uh-huh.

16
00:00:48,578 --> 00:00:51,668
(Leonard:)Now that Raj is working for Sheldon,
I don't have to chauffeur him around.

17
00:00:51,831 --> 00:00:54,791
(Leonard:)Plus, yeah, with them working late
so much, we get some privacy.

18
00:00:54,959 --> 00:00:57,019
PENNY:
Mm-hm.

